   "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
   "rendered": "<p>Algebra comes late and abruptly in school, and seems far from what pupils know. &hellip; <a href=\"https://blog.example/services/books/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading</a></p>\n",
