  "link": "https://blog.example/about-me/biography/",
  "title": {
   "rendered": "Biography of Jeanne Exemple"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\"><a title=\"Yoga\" href=\"https://blog.example/about-me/yoga/\">Next page &#8220;Yoga&#8221;</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-310 size-full\" src=\"https://blog.example/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/bg-bio.jpg\" alt=\"Jeanne Exemple\" width=\"223\" height=\"202\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Jeanne Exemple, <a title=\"international consultant and keynote speaker\" href=\"https://blog.example/services/talks-shows/\">international consultant and keynote speaker</a>, has a passion for mathematics: teacher training, conference talks, videos and live shows. </span><br style=\"color: #000000;\" /><br style=\"color: #000000;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000;\">She began her career teaching mathematics, then advised schools as an independent consultant.</span></p>\n<div style=\"padding-bottom:20px; padding-top:10px;\" class=\"hupso-share-buttons\"><!-- Hupso Share Buttons - https://www.hupso.com/share/ --><a class=\"hupso_counters\" href=\"https://www.hupso.com/share/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://static.hupso.com/share/buttons/share-small.png\" style=\"border:0px; padding-top:2px; float:left;\" alt=\"Share Button\"/></a><script type=\"text/javascript\">var hupso_services_c=new Array(\"twitter\",\"email\",\"print\");var hupso_counters_lang = \"en_US\";var hupso_title_c=\"Biography\";</script><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://static.hupso.com/share/js/counters.js\"></script><!-- Hupso Share Buttons --></div>\n",
   "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
   "rendered": "<p>Next page &#8220;Yoga&#8221; Jeanne Exemple, international consultant and keynote speaker, has a passion for mathematics.</p>\n",
   "protected": false
  },
